  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 610.08 Maintenance of a Woodland Buffer. The provisions of RSA 483-B:9, V(b) shall apply to the protected tidal zone within 150 feet of the HOTL.\n\nSource. #12806, eff 12-15-19",
